@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminCookie = replace-with-authenticated-admin-cookie

### Michigan original license report (404 before a completed collection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/michigan-bulk/exports/real-estate-licenses.xlsx
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Michigan original employer report
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/michigan-bulk/exports/real-estate-employers.xlsx
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Michigan acquisition manifest
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/michigan-bulk/exports/manifest.json
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### West Virginia acquisition manifest
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/west%20virginia-bulk/exports/manifest.json
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### West Virginia original active salesperson roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/west%20virginia-bulk/exports/SalespersonRoster.xlsx
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### West Virginia original active associate-broker roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/west%20virginia-bulk/exports/AssociateBrokerRoster.xlsx
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### West Virginia original active broker roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/west%20virginia-bulk/exports/BrokerRoster.xlsx
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}

### Unknown export returns 404 for an authenticated administrator
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/michigan-bulk/exports/unknown.xlsx
Cookie: {{adminCookie}}
